			"Message": "refactor(Sky): Simplify build pipeline and disable Wind integration layer\n\nThis commit streamlines the `Sky` (Astro) build configuration and temporarily suspends the integration with the `Wind` service layer to focus on core workbench rendering and build stability.\n\n**Build Configuration:**\n- Removed the custom `performanceMonitorPlugin` and extensive Vite optimization overrides (specifically `optimizeDeps` and `esbuildOptions`) from `astro.config.ts`. This simplifies the build process by relying on Astro's default conventions.\n- Added `@ts-expect-error` suppressions for dynamic Vite plugin imports to resolve type-checking friction.\n\n**Wind Integration Pause:**\n- Commented out the import of `@codeeditorland/wind` in the debug link configuration (`Debug.ts`).\n- Disabled the Wind preload polyfill (`Install()`) and the Effect-TS bootstrap script (`runBootstrap`) in `Default.astro` and `Wind.astro`.\n- This change decouples the Sky UI from the Wind application logic, allowing the workbench to run using the `Rest` bundles without the active `Wind` Effect layer.\n\n**Housekeeping:**\n- Cleaned up generated artifacts (`backLayerWebview.*`) from the `Target` directory.\n- Fixed Astro JSX syntax by wrapping script tags in empty fragments to satisfy the compiler.",
			"SHA": "cc42bf1416c9631eb60052a06a2ecc66533caa4c"
		},
